hadiths[24]{hadithnumber,text}:
"2862","Narrated 'Abdullah bin 'Umar:The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) as saying: It is the duty of a Muslim man who has something which is to be given as bequest not to have it for two nights without having his will written regarding it"
"2863","Narrated 'Aishah:The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) did not leave dinars"
"2864","Narrated 'Amir b. Sa'd:On the authority of his father (Sa'd b. Abi Waqqas): When he (Sa'd) fell ill at Mecca (according to the version of Ibn Abi Kkalaf) - then the agreed version has: which brought him near to death - the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) went to visit him. He said: Messenger of Allah"
"2865","Narrated Abu Hurairah:A man asked the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ): Messenger of Allah"
"2866","Narrated AbuSa'id al-Khudri: The Prophet (ﷺ) said: A man giving a dirham as sadaqah (charity) during his life is better than giving one hundred dirhams as sadaqah (charity) at the moment of his death"
"2867","Narrated AbuHurayrah: The Prophet (ﷺ) said: A man or a woman acts in obedience to Allah for sixty years"
"2868","Narrated Abu Dharr: The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) said to me: Abu Dharr"
"2869","Narrated Ibn 'Abbas:The Qur'anic verse goes: ""(It is prescribed when death approaches any of you)"
"2870","Narrated AbuHurayrah: I heard the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) say: Allah has appointed for everyone who has a right what is due to him"
"2871","Narrated Abdullah ibn Abbas: When Allah"
"2872","Narrated 'Amr b. Suh'aib: On his father's authority"
"2873","Narrated Ali ibn AbuTalib: I memorised (a tradition) from the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ): There is no orphanhood after puberty"
"2874","Narrated Abu Hurairah: The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) as saying: Refrain from seven (characteristics) which cause destruction. He was asked: What are they"
"2875","Umair"
"2876","Narrated Khabbab:Mus'ab b. 'Umar was killed at the battle of Uhud"
"2877","Narrated Buraidah:A woman came to the Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) and said: I donated my slave-girl to my mother"
"2878","Narrated Ibn 'Umar:'Umar got some land in Khaibar"
"2879","Narrated Yahya b. Sa'id:'Abd al-Hamid b. Abd 'Allah b. 'Abd Allah b. 'Umar b. al-Khattab copied to me a document about the religious endowment (waqf) made by 'Umar b. al-Khattab : In the name of Allah"
"2880","Narrated Abu Hurairah:The Messenger of Allah (ﷺ) as saying: When a man dies"
"2881","Narrated Aisha"
"2882","Narrated Ibn 'Abbas:A man said: Messenger of Allah"
"2883","Narrated 'Amr b. Suh'aib: On his father's authority"
"2884","Narrated Jabir bin ‘Abdullah :That his father died and left a debt of thirty wasqs of a Jew on him. Jabir asked him to defer"
"2885","Narrated Abdullah ibn Amr ibn al-'As: The Prophet (ﷺ) said: Knowledge has three categories; anything else is extra; a precise verse"